    "title": "LPN: Graduate Nurses Accepted, Full Time, Per Diem, Weekends (all shifts):  7-3, 3-11, 11-7",
    "company": "Essential Healthcare Management",
    "location": "Fairfield, Connecticut",
    "salary": "",
    "job_type": "",
    "description": "<p>Are you a compassionate and dedicated Licensed Practical Nurse (LPN) looking for a rewarding opportunity? Southport Center for Nursing and Rehabilitation is excited to welcome new team members to provide exceptional care to our residents.</p>\n<p><strong>Position Details:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Position Type:</strong> Full Time, Per Diem, Weekends (all shifts): &nbsp;7-3, 3-11, 11-7</li>\n<li><strong>Experience:</strong> Preferred, but we are happy to train motivated individuals eager to learn and grow in their nursing career.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>What You&rsquo;ll Need:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>A <strong>current and valid LPN license</strong> in good standing.</li>\n<li>A passion for providing quality care and supporting residents&rsquo; well-being.</li>\n<li>A positive attitude and willingness to be a team player.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Why Southport?</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Be part of a supportive, dynamic team dedicated to making a difference in residents' lives.</li>\n<li>Gain valuable experience and grow your nursing skills in a welcoming environment.</li>\n<li>Flexible scheduling.</li>\n</ul>",
