    "title": "RN Supervisor, Various Shifts Available!",
    "company": "Essential Healthcare Management",
    "location": "Fairfield, Connecticut",
    "salary": "",
    "job_type": "",
    "description": "<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Job Summary</span></p>\n<p>The primary role of the Nurse Supervisor is to supervise the day to day nursing activities of the facility in accordance to current federal, state, and local standards.&nbsp; As a nursing supervisor, you are delegated the administrative authority, responsibility,and accountability necessary for carrying out your assigned duties.</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Qualifications</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Must have be a graduate of an approved RN progam</li>\n<li>Must possess a current state license</li>\n<li>Must have at least 1 yr of experience in nursing administration, supervision or managerial capacity</li>\n<li>Must be knowledgable of nursing and medical practices and procedures</li>\n<li>Must possess leadership and supervisory ability and willingness to work</li>\n<li>Must be CPR certified</li>\n<li>Must be able to push, lift, pull, and move a minimum of 35 pounds with or without the aid of mechanical devices</li>\n<li>Must have good organizational skills,&nbsp; develop, implement, and interpret the programs, goals, objectives, policies, and procedures that are necessary for providing quality care</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Job Responsibilities</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Ensure written policies and procedures are followe</li>\n<li>Cooperate with other resident services as it relates to nursing services</li>\n<li>Ensure all nursing personnel are following their respective job descriptions</li>\n<li>Assist with process of admitting, transferring, discharging residents as necessary</li>\n<li>Monitor and assist with accident/incidents, reportable events for accuracy and completeness.&nbsp; Report to Director of Nursing and Administrator.</li>\n<li>Monitor new employee orientation programs for its effectiveness/submit suggesstions for improvement</li>\n<li>Supervise nursing staff</li>\n<li>Ensure infection control practices are maintained</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Available Shifts:&nbsp; ALL SHIFTS AVAILABLE</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
