    "title": "Physical Therapy Assistant",
    "company": "Essential Healthcare Management",
    "location": "Fairfield, Connecticut",
    "salary": "",
    "job_type": "",
    "description": "<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #424242; margin: 0px 0px 0.75rem; font-family: 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: bold;\">Seeking a Full Time and PRN Physical Therapist Assistant (PTA) to join the in-house therapy team at Southport Nursing and Rehab located in Southport, CT.</span></p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #424242; margin: 0px 0px 0.75rem; font-family: 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: bold;\">*New grads are welcome to apply! *Flexible scheduling! *Supportive therapy team to work beside!</span></p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #424242; margin: 0px 0px 0.75rem; font-family: 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: bold;\">Located at 930 Mill Hill Ter Southport, CT 06890</span></p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #424242; margin: 0px 0px 0.75rem; font-family: 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">The primary responsibility of the Physical Therapist Assistant (PTA) is to provide direct physical therapy interventions as planned, delegated, and supervised by the Physical Therapist. The person in this role will also record treatments given and note progress in medical records. In this role, you are entrusted to ensure that the highest degree of quality care can be provided to our residents at all times.</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #424242; margin: 0px 0px 0.75rem; font-family: 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: bold;\">Resident Care:</span></p>\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #595959; font-family: 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 0.625rem !important;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Provide physical therapy individualized treatment plans and needed updates to increase the client&rsquo;s independence and functioning under the supervision of a Licensed Physical Therapist and in accordance with the physician&rsquo;s orders</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Communicate changes in the resident&rsquo;s condition</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Provide accurate and timely billing records and supporting clinical documentation</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Coordinate and provide training with Restorative Nursing and other Care staff</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Provide education and training to patients, caregivers, and community partners</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Ensure compliance with all community mandatory education, training, and competence programs</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Perform screening rounds as directed by the Director of Rehabilitation to assess for client needs and environmental safety</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Provide recommendations to the Director of Rehab and other team members regarding opportunities for business improvement, safety concerns or other update</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #424242; margin: 0px 0px 0.75rem; font-family: 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #424242; margin: 0px 0px 0.75rem; font-family: 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\"><strong>Responsibilities:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #424242; font-family: 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">Ability to prioritize and multi-task priorities</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #424242; font-family: 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">Detail-oriented and follow through</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #424242; font-family: 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">Effective and efficient time management skills</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #424242; font-family: 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">Works well with people, including staff, residents and families</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #424242; font-family: 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">Ability to solve problems effectively</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #424242; margin: 0px 0px 0.75rem; font-family: 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: bold;\">Career Advantages:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #424242; font-family: 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">Rare in-house opportunity</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #424242; font-family: 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">Practice in an environment built on integrity and progressive, ethical care</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #424242; font-family: 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">Electronic documentation system</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #424242; font-family: 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">Work collaboratively with a supportive team of therapists and nursing staff</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
